{"title":"Career roadmap · Supply Chain Coordinator","role":"Supply Chain Coordinator","summary":"Build a strong foundation in commerce, procurement, logistics, inventory, Excel and supply-chain systems, then progress into planning, operations, procurement or supply-chain management.","facts":{"Starts":"2026","Current degree":"UG","Course":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Timeline assumption":"This roadmap assumes a 3-year B.Com beginning in 2026. Use the final year for supply-chain internships, Excel/ERP skills, logistics projects and job preparation. If a 4-year honours pathway is available, use the additional year for advanced supply-chain analytics, procurement, ERP and industry experience."},"about":[{"label":"Course alignment","text":"Supply Chain Coordinator is directly aligned with the B.Com – E-Commerce pathway through e-commerce operations, order management, inventory and fulfilment workflows."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Become employable in supply-chain operations through inventory, procurement, logistics, order fulfilment, Excel and ERP fundamentals."},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Specialise in supply planning, procurement, logistics, inventory management, e-commerce fulfilment or supply-chain analytics."},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Progress toward Senior Supply Chain Coordinator, Supply Planner, Procurement Analyst, Logistics Manager or Operations Manager."},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Combine supply-chain expertise with analytics, automation, AI forecasting, ERP systems, sustainability and strategic operations."}],"sections":[{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026 – Sem 1"},{"text":"Commerce, business operations and supply-chain 