, University of Warwick, University of Manchester"},{"text":"Chevening / university scholarships"},{"text":"Degree equivalence, academic requirements and English"}],[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"MIT, Michigan State University and other operations programmes"},{"text":"Fulbright / university funding"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites and English"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"University of British Columbia, University of Toronto and others"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Degree equivalence and programme requirements"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Technical University of Munich and other logistics/operations programmes"},{"text":"DAAD / university funding"},{"text":"Academic prerequisites and language"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Rotterdam School of Management and other universities"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Academic requirements and English"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Scholarship starting points:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chevening","url":"https://www.chevening.org/"},{"text":"Fulbright Foreign Scholarship Board","url":"https://foreign.fulbrightonline.org/"},{"text":"DAAD","url":"https://www.daad.de/en/"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"Degree/provisional certificate"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of purpose"},{"text":"Recommendation letters where required"},{"text":"English-language test where required"},{"text":"Passport"},{"text":"Financial documents where required"},{"text":"Scholarship documents"},{"text":"Internship/project evidence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For supply-chain programmes, highlight inventory, procurement, logistics, analytics, ERP and operational improvement projects."},{"type":"note","label":"Visa/job-offer note","text":"Visa, post-study work and employer sponsorship rules change. Verify current government requirements before applying."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supply Chain Intern","Supply Chain Coordinator / Operations Executive — 0–2 years","Supply Chain Analyst / Senior Coordinator — 2–5 years","Supply Planner / Procurement Analyst / Logistics Manager — 5–8 years","Supply Chain Manager / Planning Manager — 8–12 years","Senior Supply Chain Manager / Operations Head — 12–15+ years","Supply Chain Director / Operations Director — 15+ years"]},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"A PhD is not required for professional supply-chain work."},{"type":"p","text":"For an academic/research pathway:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com","MBA/M.Com/M.Sc relevant Master's","PhD"]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply-chain management"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"Procurement"},{"text":"Operations management"},{"text":"E-commerce operations"},{"text":"Inventory optimisation"},{"text":"Sustainable supply chains"},{"text":"Supply-chain analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact doctoral eligibility depends on the institution and programme."},{"type":"h","text":"2040–2046 relevance"},{"type":"p","text":"Future supply-chain professionals should combine operations knowledge with AI-based demand forecasting, supply-chain analytics, ERP, automation, digital procurement, sustainability, supplier-risk management and real-time logistics visibility. The long-term progression is from coordinating transactions to optimising the entire supply network."},{"type":"p","text":"Do you want to add anything else to tailor this?"}]}]}